# Everything derived from the player's dump stays local (see ../scripts/check_no_proprietary.py):
# extracted exefs/romfs, recompiled C, translated shaders, build products.
# (No trailing slash: these may be symlinks to another disk, which a "dir/" pattern would not match.)
/private
/generated
/build
*.spv
# Python environment for the recompiler (machine-specific)
/tools/venv
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
/dist
